{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf2 Magnecube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnecube</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you control a magnetic cube that must navigate levels full of obstacles and unique mechanics. With a built-in level editor, you can create and share your own challenges with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging levels</strong>: each one designed to test your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ innovative mechanics</strong>: from magnets to moving platforms, each level introduces new elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful pixel-art style</strong>: a retro aesthetic that complements the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor</strong>: create, share, and play levels made by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story mode and online multiplayer</strong>: explore levels made by the developer or play ones designed by the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Inventory integration</strong>: earn items through drops to equip your character or trade them on the Steam Market.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Why play Magnecube?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy logic and platformer games with a unique twist, <i>Magnecube</i> offers an immersive and creative experience. Its magnet-based mechanics and level design will keep you entertained for hours. And with the drop system and customizable items, the fun continues even outside the game!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fly me to the moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737600/46066686583b46be23b5462b780aa8f41ff30130.jpg"},{"name":"Brain lag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737600/e8db410c639cadb2119dae3211279bde2a452c01.jpg